    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101797" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχάσις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slitting</i> of a tree,
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κόμμι] ῥέει καὶ πληγείσης καὶ
				αὐτόματον ἄνευ σχάσεως</span> (cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίσεως</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>venesection</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.10
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				2.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>release, letting off</i>, of an engine, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				77.1
			</span></i>.</div>
